OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAn unsettled start with heavy,
OL,6,Fpersistent rain pushing westwards.
OL,7,FRain turning thundery into the
OL,8,Fafternoon with strong and squally
OL,9,Fwinds likely, with the risk of coastal
OL,10,Fgales in the south.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FFurther showers are likely
OL,13,Facross the east of the region during
OL,14,Fthe evening, however it will turn
OL,15,Fsomewhat drier from the west with
OL,16,Fclear spells developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
